## Google Gemma 4 (E2B / E4B)

- **Source URL:** https://huggingface.co/google (Gemma 4 model cards); local copy pulled via Ollama as `gemma4:e2b`
- **Licence:** Apache License 2.0 (verified 2026-10-12 with `ollama show gemma4:e2b --license`)
- **Status:** Weights used unmodified (quantised GGUF). Earlier Gemma versions (Gemma 3 and before) used the Gemma Terms of Use; those terms do not apply to Gemma 4.
- **Notice:** Ship the Apache-2.0 licence text and any NOTICE file with the weights; state that the weights are quantised.
